{"v":4,"catch":"節奏暴力","desc":"Thumper是一款節奏暴力遊戲：經典動作、猛烈的速度和野蠻的肉體衝撞。你是一隻太空甲蟲，勇敢闖入虛無空間，對抗巨大的首腦。\n\n向前邁進，掌握新動作，並在可怕的魔王戰中倖存下來。被衝擊原聲推動，你會感受到每一個破碎的影響。要達到共鳴，你必須征服節奏地獄。","publisher":"Drool LLC","release":"2022-07-14","genres":["動作","音樂","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","葡萄牙文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.2GB / Switch 1.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b02b3b996cefbbc46f7cb598348f0a8e6a16cf7ee2944c2163daf7d06d549649.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0860491946be094be7b6e0794831312f7f88d56ad5cd1ee089d19ae1c260598a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1a2de9b7c871174b8de5b086de8729c4afced7297e01e76165bce1a1b5b5e9ac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/78f77afc3101881836fc797235d05be2a6e5c932a9e103829468791a7cec47ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85ad1e32c77f58cef04ddbef73693c3be225217d595fa6179c52b441171cac6a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9477dac863da29568478b42761d4e5df6df9a47a5574dea2e6f08291c4a0ffd.jpg"],"titleId":"01006f6002840000","dlc":[]}